 "rationale": "Read-only access by a CM coordinator on a CM shared workstation during the scheduled shift, embedded in a same-morning multi-patient workflow; no U0080-P02803 connection in the identity graph and no update/print/delete actions. Nothing in the facts calls for review, so clear at low priority; confirming panel assignment would affirmatively document purpose."
